{"decisions":[{"id":"dc_da79727b15","n":8,"mod":"exp","text":"同一批跨文件修复分别运行三组检索基线和完整方法，每组用相同的三个种子，单独统计接口变更。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":"dc_c4f802f66c","materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_e86a07676a","n":7,"mod":"agents","text":"代码员工复现检索和回归测试，写作员工核对案例中的文件和调用关系。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":0,"tells":1,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_0607419360","n":6,"mod":"paper","text":"先用一次漏改调用方的案例说明问题，再呈现按仓库分组的主表。把误检文件和漏检文件分开讨论。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":2,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_4ee81f30ab","n":5,"mod":"data","text":"按仓库划分修复提交。同一接口的迁移只进一个集合。主指标是补丁测试通过率，另记修改文件召回率和接口回归率。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":2,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_c4f802f66c","n":4,"mod":"exp","text":"先在一个仓库抽查十次修复，只记录最终测试结果。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"replaced","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","replaced_by":"dc_da79727b15","counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":0,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_97e3dc5869","n":3,"mod":"code","text":"先按报错检索文件，再沿调用边扩展上下文。每次修复保存检索到的文件清单。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_765ed0aaf7","n":2,"mod":"survey","text":"用 BM25、Dense retrieval、Call graph only 作对照。逐组核对输入条件与评测预算。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[{"kind":"paper","ref":"arxiv:2510.04905","title":"Retrieval-Augmented Code Generation: A Survey with Focus on Repository-Level Approaches"}],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_9266ff854a","n":1,"mod":"overview","text":"仓库级代码 Agent：先用检索增强在整个代码仓库里定位相关文件和调用链，再让 agent 分步修改并跑测试回归，减少跨文件修改时漏改、改错接口的情况","source":"idea","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":2,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}}],"matters":[{"id":2,"agent":"lead-line_1","who":"项目负责人","question":"后续评测怎样处理一次修改涉及多个仓库的提交？","mod":"exp","facts":["现有评测按仓库划分，跨仓库提交同时涉及两个集合。","当前方法草案只定义了仓库内的调用边。"],"options":["把关联仓库放入同一测试组","单列跨仓库测试集"],"materials":[{"kind":"paper","ref":"arxiv:2510.04905","title":"Retrieval-Augmented Code Generation: A Survey with Focus on Repository-Level Approaches"}],"since":"2026-11-25T17:29:35+00:00"}],"loose":[],"stats":{"total":8,"active":7,"anchored":6,"loose":0},"mods":[{"id":"overview","name":"概览"},{"id":"survey","name":"调研"},{"id":"code","name":"代码仓库"},{"id":"exp","name":"实验"},{"id":"data","name":"数据"},{"id":"paper","name":"论文"},{"id":"agents","name":"员工"}]}